*.gguf
*.safetensors
# Data: GoEmotions raw + processed are COMMITTED on purpose (small,
# CC-BY-4.0, provenance + regeneration documented in data/README.md).
# Ignore only future ad-hoc dumps at data/ root:
data/*.csv
data/*.json
